  "body": "• Just moments from Orewa Beach – An unbeatable location where the beach is quite literally around the corner.\r\n• Perfect for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors – excellent Airbnb and holiday-home appeal.\r\n• Ground-floor courtyards – Sunny outdoor spaces front and back for entertaining, relaxing, or unwinding after a day at the beach.\r\n• Modern, low-maintenance living – Two double bedrooms, contemporary kitchen with stone benchtops, quality fittings, and underfloor heating in the bathroom.\r\n• Flat walk to shops, cafés and amenities – Leave the car at home and enjoy the convenience of village living.\r\n\r\nWhere else can you buy this close to Orewa Beach at this price point?\r\n\r\nPositioned within the popular De La Plage complex, this ground-floor apartment delivers the ultimate low-maintenance coastal lifestyle. Just a short stroll from the sand, it's the kind of location buyers are always searching for, whether that's a first-home buyer wanting to embrace beachside living, a downsizer seeking convenience, or an investor looking for a property with strong holiday and Airbnb appeal.\r\n\r\nThe well-designed two-bedroom layout opens to sunny courtyards at both the front and rear, creating the perfect spaces for morning coffee, summer barbecues, or relaxing after a swim at the beach. Inside, the modern kitchen features stone benchtops and quality finishes, while the bathroom offers the added comfort of underfloor heating.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and this one is hard to beat. With Orewa Beach, cafés, shops, restaurants and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance, this is an opportunity to secure an affordable slice of one of the Coast's most sought-after beachside communities. Whether you're looking to live in, lock up and leave, or invest, this is coastal convenience at its best.",
